# The repo is edited on Windows but deployed on Linux. A CRLF shebang makes the
# kernel look for an interpreter literally named "bash\r", so pin the files that
# the server executes (or parses) to LF regardless of anyone's core.autocrlf.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.service text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.env text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
